message: "If you use this software, its data, or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Oralbiome: A Retrospective Audit of Oral-Microbiome Diabetes-Status Transfer"
abstract: >-
  Working research on cross-study transfer, using an oral-only retrospective
  reconstruction with source-study exclusions for related benchmarks. Conditional
  uncertainty does not establish a confident South African reversal. External studies
  informed development; results are exploratory, not clinical validation. NHANES
  labels do not establish T2D subtype. The working manuscript is publicly hosted; no peer review is claimed.
